              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Sword or axe. Light armour +3, shield +2; thrusting spear, throwing spear or javelins +2; a Prince of the Apuani may have a pennato (+2). Army General, Warband. (Hannibal p.78)</characteristic>
