            <profile id="0253-7186-5ddb-c36a" name="Equipment and options (as printed in WAB2 army list)" publicationId="fc9f-8438-629b-e92d" hidden="false" typeId="b19e-ee0c-17d1-6e33" typeName="Equipment and Notes">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Sword or axe. Light armour +3, shield +2; thrusting spear, throwing spear or javelins +2; a Chieftain of the Apuani may have a pennato (+2). May be Army General (+25 pts). Warband. (Hannibal p.78)</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
